      "title": "Streams cheat sheet",
      "topicId": "flutter-streams",
      "daysAgo": 5,
      "content": "# Streams\n\n- **Single-subscription** by default; `asBroadcastStream()` for many listeners.\n- Always keep the `StreamSubscription` and `cancel()` it.\n- `await for` reads a stream like a loop.\n\n```dart\nawait for (final value in numbers()) {\n  print(value);\n}\n```\n"
    },
